{
  "id": "average_velocity",
  "title": "Average Velocity",
  "description": "Distance traveled vs. time used. Calculate the average velocity of an object using the formula v = ds / dt",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Average Velocity\n\nThe average velocity of an object can be expressed as:\n\n**v = ds / dt**\n\nWhere:\n- **v** = average velocity of object (m/s, ft/s)\n- **ds** = distance traveled (m, ft)\n- **dt** = time taken (s)\n\n## Example\nA car travels a distance of 60 km in one hour:\n- v = (60 km × 1000 m/km) / (1 hour × 3600 s/hour)\n- v = 16.7 m/s\n- v = 60 km/h"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "distance",
          "label": "Distance Traveled",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m",
          "defaultValue": 60000
        },
        {
          "id": "time",
          "label": "Time Taken",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "s",
          "defaultValue": 3600
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "velocity",
          "label": "Average Velocity",
          "formula": "inputs.distance / inputs.time",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity_kmh",
          "label": "Average Velocity",
          "formula": "(inputs.distance / inputs.time) * 3.6",
          "unit": "km/h",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Distance (m)",
        "Time (s)",
        "Velocity (m/s)",
        "Velocity (km/h)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          1000,
          60,
          16.67,
          60
        ],
        [
          5000,
          300,
          16.67,
          60
        ],
        [
          60000,
          3600,
          16.67,
          60
        ],
        [
          100,
          10,
          10,
          36
        ],
        [
          500,
          25,
          20,
          72
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}